### VS Code ###
.vscode/

# Embedded TDchatBot runtime session (TDLib auth data, changes on every run).
# The code + binaries (src/.../ir/linuxian, libs/, native/) ARE committed.
tdlib-data/

# Contact-encryption secret (auto-generated on first boot when no
# APP_CRYPTO_KEY env var is set). NEVER commit: losing it is fine
# (a new one is generated), but LEAKING it exposes stored emails/phones.
# Back it up alongside database backups instead.
.app-crypto-key
